        "timestamp": 1791655374767,
        "delta": "I can't add a machine or server directly. The tools I have can add a **Service**, which Ployz runs on the Environment's Nodes. Staging currently has three Services: `db` (postgres:17), `web` (nginx:1.27), and `worker` (acme/worker).\n\nIf a new Service is what you need, tell me:\n\n1. **Name**, which is also its private DNS name (for example, `cache`).\n2. **Container image** (for example, `redis:7`). Leave it blank to create an empty Service and configure it later.\n\nI'll add it to staging. It stays staged until you publish or deploy it.",
        "content": "I can't add a machine or server directly. The tools I have can add a **Service**, which Ployz runs on the Environment's Nodes. Staging currently has three Services: `db` (postgres:17), `web` (nginx:1.27), and `worker` (acme/worker).\n\nIf a new Service is what you need, tell me:\n\n1. **Name**, which is also its private DNS name (for example, `cache`).\n2. **Container image** (for example, `redis:7`). Leave it blank to create an empty Service and configure it later.\n\nI'll add it to staging. It stays staged until you publish or deploy it."
